	'contact_s2_p2' => 'If you are running late, call the desk on +1 (555) 014-2200 while we are open. Messages left after 18:30 on a weekday, or after 13:00 on Saturday, are picked up on the next open morning. Seven clinicians work from this address. There is no second branch.',
