	'fv3_h' => 'A plan agreed together',
	'fv3_p1' => 'Before you leave that visit: a plan agreed together. We tell you whether the next step is a repositioning visit, rehabilitation sessions, a falls-risk screen, or a letter saying this clinic is not the right place. You should not leave the hour unsure which of those it is.',
	'fv4_h' => 'Sessions and daily home exercises',
