	'newsletter_s1_p2' => 'It might say what to expect from the 60-minute first assessment. It does not publish personal stories beyond the three we already tell with permission, and it does not announce awards or results rates. Mara, Theo and Ines stay on the stories page, each with the same limit: outcomes differ from person to person.',
