	'newsletter_s2_p2' => 'The form asks for your email and nothing else. Booking a first assessment is separate: call +1 (555) 014-2200 or write with the subject First assessment request, and use the contact page if you want to include symptoms, timing and preferred days. You can ask the desk to take you off Balance notes by emailing the same address.',
